  "worked_solution": "The slope of the line tangent to the graph of $P(v)$ at $v=4$ gives the derivative of $P(v)$ at $v=4.$ So, we have that\n\n$$\n{P}^{\u2032}(4)=0.5.\n$$\n\nWe can interpret the above statement as\n\n$\\,$ *When $4$ liters of lemonade are sold the previous day, the price is increasing at a rate of $50$ cents per liter.*",
